UID:261121AuOkSmvFdESFMFURhlmqNw
DESCRIPTION:Salsa social dancing in Novato\n\nDATE: November 21@ 6:30 PM\n
 \nEVERY 1st and 3rd Saturday of the months\n\nTIME 6:30 PM\n\nWHERE: TOAST
 \, 5800 Nave Dr\, Novato\n\nIndoor dancing\, beautiful dance floor and A/C
 \n\n6:30 PM – 7:15 PM: Beginner Salsa Class (45 min) 7:15 PM – 10:30 P
 M: Social Dancing (Salsa\, Bachata\, & Merengue)\n\nGet ready to move! Joi
 n us for an evening of rhythm and community at our bi-monthly dance social
  in Novato. Whether you’re a seasoned pro or have never stepped foot on 
 a dance floor\, there’s a spot for you.\n\nWhen & Where\n\n• Date: Eve
 ry 1st & 3rd Saturday\n\n• Time: 6:30 PM – 10:30 PM\n\n• Location: T
 OAST\, 5800 Nave Dr\, Novato\n\nThe Schedule\n\n• 6:30 PM – 7:15 PM: B
 eginner Salsa Class (45 min)\n\n• 7:15 PM – 10:30 PM: Social Dancing (
 Salsa\, Bachata\, & Merengue)\n\n• NOVEMBER 21 DJ CITY MIX\n\nAdmission 
 salsa social dancing in Novato\n\n• Presale: $15\n\n• At the Door: $20
 \n\n• Tickets/Info: **www.salsadancemarin.com/events**\n\n• Questions?
  Call 415-342-1649\n\nFood & Drink\n\n• Dinner: Full menu available unti
 l 8:00 PM.\n\n• Drinks: All Night\n\nPro Tip: Arrive early to fuel up on
  some delicious food at TOAST before the social dancing kicks into high ge
 ar!
LOCATION:Toast Restaurant
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/social-dancing-novato/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Park Rx-Yoga Hikes 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T123000
UID:261121-IlrRthiDU6D7reccVDHMw
DESCRIPTION:Susan Topf’s Yoga Hike balances a mix of easy hiking and gen
 tle yoga postures\, breath work and guided meditation\, no mat necessary. 
 The route varies on weather conditions and group interest\, typically cove
 ring 2-3 miles of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome.\n\nTickets 
 are $20. Please wear weather-appropriate clothing to feel comfortable bein
 g in a natural setting and bring water \\(as needed\\). Meet outside the V
 isitor Center unless otherwise noted in the reminder email prior to the hi
 ke. Limited to 12 participants. \n\nSonoma County Resident? Free with a S
 eptember 2026 or newer Park Rx from a participating Sonoma County Medical 
 Provider. To sign up with a Park Rx\, please forward a PDF of your signed 
 Rx to alma@sonomaecologycenter.org for a sign up code.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/2026yoga-hikes
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
