UID:261115P91XFOfY0k-JBMP63gGJ1Q
DESCRIPTION:$10 Adults\n\n$5 Kids Ages 12 and under\n\nTHIS IS THE TICKET 
 PURCHASING PAGE FOR STUDENT SHOWCASE \\#2 at 4:30pm.\n\n\\*Please confirm 
 which Showcase \\(\\#1 or \\#2\\) they are performing in with the Student 
 you are coming to see.\n\nFor tickets to Student Showcase \\#1 at 12:00pm\
 n\nhttps://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket\\#/instances/a0FUh
 00000DWKSLMA5 \n\nDoors at 3:30pm.\n\nShow from 4:00-6:00pm\n\nFeaturing
  multiple musical genres including jazz\, soul\, musical theater\, folk\, 
 country\, pop\, indie and original compositions.\n\nShawna Hervé is a nat
 ive of Sonoma County and an alumnus of the Sonoma State University music d
 epartment. She has been singing in bands since the age of fifteen explorin
 g folk\, rock\, funk\, blues\, jazz\, R&B\, reggae and country. Shawna sta
 rted her business as a private singing instructor in 2004 at Stanroy Music
  Center in Santa Rosa and currently sustains a work load of approximately 
 60 students. Outside of teaching\, Shawna composes original music\, playin
 g keys and mandolin with her husband Cory\, and fellow early music bassist
  Dan Turkos in their trio\, Off the Perch. She is often hired  out to do 
 recording work for other artists as well\, singing backup or lead on their
  original compositions. Shawna has a teenage son who plays piano and drums
  and is enrolled at Santa Rosa High School. She loves to travel\, connect 
 with friends\, and spend time with her mini-Aussie doggie daughter\, Nala.
  https://www.reverbnation.com/shawnamama707
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket#/instances/a0FUh0
 0000DWKfFMAX
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
