SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Growlers vs. Chicago Misfits
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T230000
UID:2611205CoqK9M4rEe9Djd2E4HXxA
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of the action as our players showcase their talent\,
  teamwork and determination during this exhilarating matchup. Witness fast
 -paced action\, as the the Santa Rosa Growlers battle it out against the C
 hicago Misfits!!\n\nDoors Open at 7:30 p.m.Puck Drops at 8:00 p.m.
