BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Grounded: A Balance + Stability Workshop at Cabuya Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T153000
UID:261120vxJEXBmkgkOD_E4Zq0OZyw
DESCRIPTION:Grounded: A Balance + Stability Workshop with Stephanie – $4
 5\n\nCabuya Yoga + Fitness • Santa Rosa\, CA | Sunday\, Nov 22 • 02:00
  PM – 03:30 PM PST\n\nwith Stephanie Koffler\n\nThe Sunday before Thanks
 giving\, give yourself somewhere steady to stand.\n\nWho it’s for: All l
 evels. No advanced experience needed\, just curiosity and a sense of play.
 \n\nThe holidays have a way of pulling us off center. Travel\, family\, fu
 ll calendars\, and everyone wanting a piece of you. This workshop is ninet
 y minutes to find your footing first\, in your body and in your head\, bef
 ore the season sweeps you up.\n\nWe’ll treat balance as something you bu
 ild\, not something you either have or don’t. Through strength\, mobilit
 y\, breath\, and focus\, Stephanie will take it apart piece by piece and h
 elp you put it back together.\n\nExpect a practice that’s equal parts pl
 ay and challenge. You’ll start with balances that feel familiar\, then w
 ork toward harder ones like warrior 3 variations and revolved half moon\, 
 linked by slow\, creative transitions. You’ll experiment with where you 
 look\, how you breathe\, and where your weight sits\, and feel how much ea
 ch one changes. Every posture has an easier and a harder way in\, so you c
 hoose your challenge as you go.\n\nBecause it’s a workshop\, you get mor
 e of Stephanie than a regular class allows: one-on-one coaching\, hands-on
  assists with your consent\, and modifications built around how your body 
 moves.\n\nWe’ll come down to the floor for a grounding sequence\, then t
 ake time to talk\, ask questions\, and share what came up. You’ll leave 
 steadier than you arrived\, with a few tools to carry into the weeks ahead
 .\n\nMats\, blocks\, and props provided.
LOCATION:Cabuya Yoga + Fitness
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/grounded-a-balance-stability-wor
 kshop-at-cabuya-yoga/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
