DESCRIPTION:"Fresh Work" featuring artworks by Mylette Welch and Bruce K H
 opkins\, with guest artists Nancy Dempster\, Hilary Mosberg\, Erin O'Brien
  & Teri Sloat\, along with selections of art by Sonoma County Open Studio 
 Artists. Opens Thursday\, October 29\, Artists reception Saturday\, Octobe
 r 31\, 1-4pm\, with music provided by Jeremy Lipsin.
LOCATION:Graton Gallery
