BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trans Day of Remembrance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T200000
UID:2611209CJrRofVK0iaiNdy1VkyxA
DESCRIPTION:Transgender Day of Remembrance \\(TDOR\\) is an annual event w
 hich honors our transgender and nonbinary loved ones whom we have lost in 
 the last year\, frequently due to violence. This day\, while a somber one\
 , is essential in remembering and honoring our kin and healing together as
  a community. Join us for an event filled with powerful guest speakers\, m
 oving eulogization\, and deep community connections. This event is free & 
 open to the public. Doors open at 4:30 pm. Speakers at 5:00 pm.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/trans-day-of-remembrance/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
