  & Hay\, where Italian tradition and seasonal flavors come together around
  the table. The four-course holiday menu offers plenty to savor\, from hou
 se-made pastas and black truffle risotto to herb-roasted porchetta\, whole
  branzino\, and butternut squash and forest mushroom lasagna. Linger over 
 an indulgent dessert and enjoy the simple pleasure of celebrating Christma
 s over a memorable meal in Napa Valley.
LOCATION:Olive & Hay
