DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T170000
UID:261119nOpwjZoZfUCEUv_LPn35Bw
DESCRIPTION:Spend Thanksgiving on Tomales Bay. Mable’s is serving a four
 -course dinner\, with a seasonal menu built from Point Reyes blue cheese a
 nd a turkey ballotine with all the traditional sides.\n\nFirst Course\n\nB
 utternut Squash Soup: toasted pepitas\, brown butter\, sage\n\nServed with
  dinner rolls and focaccia with herb butter\n\nSecond Course\n\nChicory Sa
 lad: Point Reyes blue cheese\, dates\, toasted hazelnuts\, balsamic vinaig
 rette\n\nThird Course\n\nTurkey Ballotine: breast and thigh\, whipped pota
 toes\, Brussels sprouts\, herb stuffing\, cranberry compote\, turkey gravy
 \n\nDessert \\(choose one\\)\n\nPumpkin Crème Caramel: pâte sucrée crum
 ble\, Chantilly cream\, warm spices\n\nSpiced Pear Crisp: vanilla gelato \
 \(gluten-free\; dairy-free without the gelato\\)\n\n$110 per person\, incl
 uding a specialty cocktail or glass of bubbles. Vegetarian and vegan subst
 itutions are available. Please note the menu contains nuts\, and let us kn
 ow about any allergies when you reserve.
