DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261127T173000
UID:261121jAomXV50G06VNYYGagkePQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Sonoma locals Adrienne and Tito\, founders of No Venom\, 
 for a spirited tasting experience at The Porch. Discover five thoughtfully
  crafted non-alcoholic cocktails\, including the Vesper\, Fer-de-Lance\, S
 idewinder\, Black Mamba\, and Blue Racer\, as they share the ingredients a
 nd inspiration behind each creation. Enjoy them alcohol-free or add a litt
 le "venom" with Lighthouse Gin or Higher Ground Vodka\, and discover how t
 hese locally inspired cocktails have found a home on the menu at Layla.
LOCATION:MacArthur Place 
