UID:261120mtgq5wdnB0KKtGCUKIsQqQ
DESCRIPTION:Price: $40 \\(Marin Center Fees Included\\)\n\nTicket Info: ht
 tps://tickets.marincenter.org/eventperformances.asp?evt=376\n\nSometimes w
 e may wonder but comedians actually have families\, too\, that they visit 
 during holidays. We're fortunate that much credited and ama zingly funny M
 o Mandel grew up in Boonville with a psychiatrist as a father. It made him
  what he is today - a top comedian with a unique perspective. Mo will be h
 eadlining a four-act show guaranteed to help burn off those Thanksgiving d
 inner calories with laughter!\n\nMo is a comedian and actor who recently a
 ppeared on Netflix's hit show\, NOBODY WANTS T HIS\, as well on HBO's icon
 ic series CURB YOUR ENTHUSIASM. In the past Mo was a frequent guest on CON
 AN and CHELSEA LATELY while also appearing on big podcasts like WTF w/ MAR
 C MARON\, ADAM CAROLLA\, BERTCAST \, YOUR MOM'S HOUSE\, and THE FIGHTER AN
 D THE KID. Mo has also gue st-starred on hit sitcoms such as MODERN FAMILY
 \, CASTLE\, and HAPPY END INGS. And if that's not enough\, Mo also created
  COMEDY KNOCKOUT for truTV\, and was the head writer on THEO VON's show MA
 N UP\, w hich aired on COMEDY CENTRAL. You catch him soon on COMIC'S UNLEA
  SHED on CBS.
