BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Very Merry Weekend
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T180000
UID:261116VxGZsyJRwkOxdXsgkhc00w
DESCRIPTION:Join us for A Very Merry Weekend at Montgomery Village!\n\nCel
 ebrate the season with a weekend of exclusive retail offerings\, family-fr
 iendly entertainment\, festive trimmings at every turn\, and more.\n\nFrid
 ay\, November 27:\n\nLive holiday music from 12pm-2pm in The Courtyard\, c
 ourtesy of Jimmy Galvan.\n\nHoliday caroling from 3:30pm to 5:30pm across 
 property\, courtesy of Silver Belles Caroling Group.\n\nSaturday\, Novembe
 r 28:\n\nWeekend Santa Sightings begin! Photos with Santa take place in Th
 e Courtyard on weekends from Saturday\, November 28 to Sunday\, December 2
 0\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily. Appointments are highly recommended. A portio
 n of proceeds from Weekend Santa Sightings benefit Sonoma County Secret Sa
 nta Program. Book your spot here.\n\nCelebrate Small Business Saturday by 
 supporting local small businesses across the Village.\n\nCelebrate the sea
 son at our Second Annual Tree Lighting Celebration on Saturday\, November 
 28\, from 5–7 p.m. in The Courtyard!\n\nEnjoy a festive evening filled w
 ith holiday music\, creative activities\, and a special appearance by Sant
 a and Mrs. Claus. Admission is free\, with seasonal fun for the whole fami
 ly:\n\nLive holiday music and carolers\, plus a family-friendly holiday si
 ngalong at 6:45 p.m.\n\n\\- Complimentary hot cocoa\n\n\\- Churros and coo
 kies available for purchase\n\n\\- Complimentary caricature portraits\n\n\
 \- Custom wood-burned gift tags\n\n\\- Make-your-own mini snowmen and jing
 le bell wreath ornaments\n\n\\- Write your letters to Santa\, delivered th
 rough the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbox\n\n\\- A special 
 visit from Santa and Mrs. Claus\n\n\\- Make the evening a little sweeter w
 ith a stop at Salt & Straw. During the event\, enjoy a complimentary scoop
  with the purchase of a scoop\, available November 28\, 2026\, from 5–7 
 p.m.\n\nSunday\, November 29:\n\nLive holiday music in The Courtyard\n\nAB
 OUT SONOMA COUNTY SECRET SANTA\n\nSonoma County’s Secret Santa is a nonp
 rofit gift-giving program\, providing gifts and holiday cheer to those les
 s fortunate in our community.\n\nSecret Santa has been bringing joy to peo
 ple throughout Sonoma County for over 30 years\, ensuring that children\, 
 teens\, adults\, and seniors who would not otherwise receive a holiday gif
 t have reason to celebrate and experience the compassion and generosity of
  their community.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/a-very-merry-weekend-2/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Weekend Santa Sightings
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T150000
UID:261116-hipQxszHUG98H2lDHVvuA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the holidays and join us at the Village for photos w
 ith Santa happening on weekends from Saturday\, November 28th to Sunday\, 
 December 20th\, 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. daily.\n\nAppointments are highly recomm
 ended\, as we cannot guarantee that we can accommodate all walk-ups throug
 hout the event series. Reserve your 5-minute window now for a $35 fee duri
 ng our initial release (through Friday\, November 13). Beginning Saturday\
 , November 14\, the fee increases to $45. Each family will receive a print
  to take home that day\, as well as a digital copy of their photo followin
 g the appointment. Please note that we do not call or text waitlisted gues
 ts.\\*\n\nMake the most of your Santa visit:\n\nYour photo package include
 s up to five digital photos\, emailed the Monday following your appointmen
 t\, plus a print to take home that day.\n\nEnjoy writing letters to Santa 
 and dropping them off at the official Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbo
 x\, plus crafts at our holiday craft tables.\n\nSweeten your visit! Stop b
 y Salt & Straw before or after your appointment and enjoy a complimentary 
 kids’ scoop with any ice cream purchase during Weekend Santa Sightings (
 valid each Saturday and Sunday from 11/28/26 to 12/20/26 between 11 a.m. t
 o 3 p.m.).\n\nKeep an eye out for ME SPA’s elves\, spreading holiday che
 er and a little stress relief with special cards to redeem at the spa. Bri
 ng yours in for a Chill Bag\, a holiday survival kit filled with goodies a
 nd coupons to help you keep your cool all season long. For an extra moment
  of relaxation\, enjoy a complimentary chair massage as scheduling allows.
 \n\nRetro Foto will be assisting in making this memory last a lifetime by 
 providing Santa with a vintage ride for all to enjoy! Retro Foto is Sonoma
  County’s boutique photo booth experience. Lola is a fully restored 1970
  Volkswagen bus that loves the camera – whether it’s as a photo booth 
 or a photo backdrop! Lola is all about making memories\, which is why Sant
 a thought this would be the perfect way to drive into the Holiday season!\
 n\nBy attending this event\, guests consent to appear in photo/video recor
 dings that may be used for website photography or other purposes.\n\n\\*A 
 portion of proceeds will benefit Sonoma County Secret Santa Program.
LOCATION:Montgomery Village - Courtyard
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/weekend-santa-sightings/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
