 0 am - 4:00 pm Juried Student Show Opening Reception Thursday\, November 1
 9th\, 4:00 pm - 6:00 pm Jurors - Arleene Correa Valencia\, Artist Loretta 
 Esparza\, Curator & Public Services Librarion\, Santa Rosa Junior College 
 Juror talk Wednesday\, November 4th at Noon in Art 102. Pizza and drinks p
 rovided Open to all SSU students - please see detailed instructions on how
