 oined by pianist and accordionist Colin Hogan for an intimate duo perform
 ance of “Cool Yule” at the Sons of Norway's Freya Lodge\, Sunday\, Dec
 ember 6 at 2:00. The duo will spread warm holiday spirit throughout the l
 odge with their delightful Nordic and American holiday songs. Tickets avai
 lable using the payment link at: freyalodge.org. Or mail a check to Sons o
 f Norway\, Freya Lodge\, P.O. Box 6558\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95406 no later th
 an 11/25/2026.\n\nThank you to Fogline Vineyards for their support of this
  event. All ages will enjoy the performance\, and we may even get a surpri
 se visit from Julenisse!
LOCATION:Norway Hall - Sons of Norway
URL:http://www.freyalodge.org
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
