 of year\, plus once this piece you've created has been fired we'll all rec
 onvene and create both a special floral arrangement specifically for this 
 event and we'll learn how to paint a watercolor still life combing all of 
 these elements into a truly unique piece of Art! This workshop meets twice
 \, our first meeting is Sunday October 4th 10am - 2pm where we host you fo
 r our clay play and Sunday October 25th 10am - 2pm for our Floral arrangin
 g and Watercolor Still Life painting We'll cover Ceramic Slab Building tec
 hniques for our vases\, floral arranging and basic Watercolor techniques f
 or our still life. We supply: Clay\, Slab Templates\, Ceramic Tools\, We'l
 l provide the Glaze and Glazing once your vases have been bisque fired\, a
 ll flowers needed for arranging at the 2nd meeting of this workshop\, Frog
 /Floral Structural Mechanics/Floral Tape for arrangements\, watercolors fo
