DESCRIPTION:The Rodney Strong wines you love\, shaken\, stirred\, and dres
 sed up for the holidays! Gather your friends\, bring your holiday spirit\,
  and join us for a hands-on Holiday Wine Cocktail Class in our beautifully
  decorated tasting room. Guided by an expert mixologist\, you'll learn how
  to craft two signature low-alcohol cocktails featuring our award-winning 
 Rodney Strong wines while enjoying an evening filled with seasonal cheer\,
  delicious bites\, and festive fun. Your ticket includes: make & enjoy 2 s
