 g our Family Matinee Concert Series**! This season\, we're growing from tw
 o concerts each year to **five exciting interactive performances** desig
 ned to inspire curiosity\, creativity\, and a love of jazz in audiences of
  all ages.\n\nBest of all\, **every Family Matinee concert is completely 
 FREE**\, making it easy for children\, parents\, grandparents\, and music 
 lovers of all ages to experience world-class jazz together.\n\n**Please he
 lp us spread the word!** Because these concerts are offered **free of ch
 arge**\, we're relying on our community to help us reach as many families 
