UID:261117NRGvKBRFSES6B9DtePam0g
DESCRIPTION:Curious about tracing your family roots? Join Simone Kremkau\,
  a librarian from the Sonoma County Library in downtown Santa Rosa\, for a
  lively introduction to genealogy and family history research. Learn tips 
 and tools on how to use the library's e-resources\, digital collections\, 
 and free online databases to explore your family's history - from local re
 cords to statewide and national resources. Advanced registration is encour
 aged\, but not required. You must register in order to receive an email re
 minder for the event. Join us at Rincon Valley Regional Library!
LOCATION:Rincon Valley Regional Library
URL:https://events.sonomalibrary.org/event/discovering-your-roots-introduc
 tion-genealogy-121973
