BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma's 5th Annual Holiday Makers Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T200000
UID:261119es0cR2_JcUWx3MpSKLlA7A
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at **the Barber Lee Spirits Distillery in downto
 wn Petaluma** for a festive day of shopping\, creativity\, and holiday ch
 eer! Our **in-person** event features a wide variety of talented local a
 rtisans and makers showcasing their unique crafts and creations. Discover 
 one-of-a-kind gifts\, handmade jewelry\, beautiful artwork\, woodworking\,
  metal craft\, and more! Sip our cocktails and wine while you shop\, and e
 njoy all of the decorations in our decked-out distillery!\n\n**FREE Ticket
 s are required (and will have a time reservation\, so we can space out the
  crowd.)**\n\nChildren do not need tickets.\n\n**For the first time\, we a
 re having the Makers Fair at our own distillery and are making this event 
 more intimate with less attendees and a smaller selection of curated vendo
 rs.** We will have full service of all of our cocktails\, wine\, beer\, fo
 od\, etc in the front of the house\, with the vendors available for shoppi
 ng on our production floor.\n\nTable seating will be available on a first 
 come- first serve basis.\n\nExplore the charming booths\, chat with the ma
 kers\, and find that perfect present for your loved ones. Whether you're l
 ooking for something whimsical\, stylish\, or practical\, you'll find it h
 ere. Support local businesses and enjoy the warm\, welcoming atmosphere. 
 **Get your free tickets soon!**
LOCATION:Barber Lee Spirits
URL:http://holidayfoodfair.com/makersfair
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
