DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261213T180000
UID:260827AZ9bCJXIaE6VGYWrpROypg
DESCRIPTION:As weather permits\, we&\\#39\;ll have our collection of yard 
 games out on the lawn. Choose from Giant Jenga\, Giant Connect 4\, giant Y
 ahtzee\, Darts\, Disc golf Putter and Cornhole. On blistery days\, we&\\#3
 9\;ll have board games\, cards and dice inside.\n\nWe have an incredible s
 election of fine wines to warm you from inside and Mad House Foods will be
  here every week from 12-3pm serving up smashed burgers\, pulled pork and 
 loaded fries.\n\nOur policy prohibits outside food and drinks. We apprecia
 te your understanding and cooperation.
LOCATION:Shannon Family of Wines
URL:https://lakeportmainstreet.com/events/
