DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 3rd Tuesday of the month for engaging and livel
 y conversation! Our September\, October\, November and December meetings w
 ill be held at Burton Avenue Recreation Center at 7421 Burton Avenue \\(Ro
 hnert Park\\) Book Club titles and dates are subject to change. For up to 
 date information visit: sonomalibrary.org/bookclubs 2026 Schedule January 
 20 - On Earth We're Briefly Gorgeous by Ocean Vuong February 17 - The Berr
 y Pickers by Amanda Peters March 17 - The Kamogawa Food Detectives by Hisa
 shi Kashiwai April 21 - The Measure by Nikki Erlick May 19 - The Secret Wa
 r of Julia Child by Diana Chambers June 16 - All the Colors of the Dark by
  Chris Whitaker July 21 - The Truth According to Ember by Danica Nava Augu
 st 18 - North Woods by Daniel Mason September 15 - Roses\, in the Mouth of
  a Lion by Bushra Rehman \\(at Burton Avenue Recreation Center\\) October 
