BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T203000
UID:261023RfU86JJHtU6T04ND8Dv8HA
DESCRIPTION:**New Moon Circus Presents ‘La Lune Brille’: a highly orig
 inal\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acrobatics and 
 athletically stunning skill.**\n\n**Sonoma\, CA— November 27 - Dec 27 
 –** This 2026 winter season\, New Moon Circus invites audiences to ‘La
  Lune Brille’ — memorable family fun and stunning artistry under the i
 ntimate and charming atmosphere of the ‘petite’ big top.\n\nMeet the W
 inter moon and her frenemy\, the Sun.  When the moon is pushed from the s
 ky\, she must find a way home to the stars. Come along the journey as she 
 encounters mysterious beings and friendly creatures on the way.\n\nA child
  pleasing origin myth told through impressive aerialists\, jugglers\, acro
 bats\, and clever comedy\, this show blends classic storybook atmosphere w
 ith celestial magic. La Lune Brille will surprise\, dazzle and delight all
  ages.\n\nSpectators for all showings are invited to the European style ci
 rcus tent to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before each show. Corne
 rstone Sonoma will provide light concession and libations for purchase. \
 n\nThe event will include a 15 minute intermission during the 1 and a half
  hour show.\n\nLimited free parking is available at the location at Corner
 stone Sonoma.\n\nTickets for La Lune Brille are now available for purchase
  online at thenewmooncircus.com.\n\nIndividual ticket prices start at $40.
  Front row (VIP)\, options start at $65. Find showtimes and more details a
 t thenewmooncircus.com. Early booking is encouraged for this highly antici
 pated event.
LOCATION:CORNERSTONE SONOMA - Under the Big Top Tent  
URL:https://newmooncircus.ticketspice.com/new-moon-circus
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gather & Graze Family-Style Tasting Experience at The Duckhorn Col
 lection
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261218T140000
UID:261021X-7g-NBhY0CFQEk9HPPdyg
DESCRIPTION:At The Duckhorn Collection\, we believe memories are created w
 hen people gather\, share stories\, and truly connect. This wine and food 
 experience is served family-style\, featuring wines from across our portfo
 lio. Each course is designed to inspire exploration and play\, encouraging
  you to mix\, match and savor. You may even uncover an unexpected favorite
  along the way and an idea you can bring home with you!\n\nThis experience
  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\nMENU:\n\nGATHER\n\n2021 Goldeneye 
 Brut Rosé\n\nRoasted Beet Mosaic\n\nFeta\, Squash\, Chickpeas\, & Walnuts
 \n\n2023 Calera Mt. Harlan Chardonnay\n\nBrown Butter Potato Gnocchi\n\nBr
 ussels Sprouts\, Sous-vide Bacon\, Calvados & Sage\n\n2023 Duckhorn Rector
  Creek Merlot\n\nGRA Z E\n\nHeirloom Floriani Red Flint Corn Polenta\n\nWi
 ld Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Creek Cabernet 
 - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegetable Gremolat
 a\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nSAVOR\n\nPear Butter Ca
 ke\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPairing: 2021 Caler
 a Viognier Doux\n\n- Please note this is a 21 and over experience\n\n- Gro
 up size: 2-6 guests﻿﻿\n\n- Duration: Please allow 90-120 minutes for t
 his experience
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
