BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The LIME Foundation’s LIME Day – Annual Food Drive
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T140000
UID:261027WqJaZu_VmEe1bTxrRpiZ2Q
DESCRIPTION:Make an impact this holiday! Join LIME Day\, our annual food d
 rive giving back to the community.\n\n**Date & Time:** December 19th\, 8:
 00 AM – 2:00 PM **Location:** 1400 Petaluma Hill Rd\, Santa Rosa\n\nLIM
 E Day is the LIME Foundation’s annual food drive\, giving back to the co
 mmunity by supporting our NextGen graduates and their families. Over 92% o
 f our graduates come from low-income families\, and this holiday season\, 
 we’re surprising families across Sonoma\, Marin\, Napa\, Mendocino\, and
  Lake counties with boxes of food and holiday cheer.\n\n**Schedule:**\n\n8
 :00 – 10:00 AM: Prepare food boxes\n\n10:00 AM – 12:00 PM: Deliver foo
 d boxes\n\n12:00 – 2:00 PM: Holiday BBQ celebration\n\nWe’re looking f
 or volunteers to help prepare and deliver food boxes. To volunteer your ti
 me and give back\, please reach out to support@thelimefoundation.org\n\nWe
  also welcome **donations** of:\n\nNonperishable items such as canned fo
 od\, rice\, beans\, and more\n\nFresh fruits and vegetables (accepted on L
 IME Day)\n\nGrocery gift cards – these help us purchase extra food and i
 nclude some in the boxes\n\nDrop-off locations will be posted soon.\n\nJoi
 n us in making this holiday season special for NextGen graduates and their
  families! For questions\, email **support@thelimefoundation.org** or ca
 ll **707-532-LIME (5463)**.
LOCATION:LIME Foundation Headquarters 
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/the-lime-foundation-s-l
 ime-day-annual-food-drive/20279600/2026-12-19T08
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
