SUMMARY:Nutcracker Suite
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T203000
UID:261022UDp_eFt_uk-uS15HAEgnmA
DESCRIPTION:The Marcus Shelby Orchestra will perform the magical “Harlem
  Nutcracker Suite” by Duke Ellington and Billy Strayhorn\, which is a ma
 sterpiece musical re-arrangement and orchestration of the well-known “Nu
 tcracker” by classical composer Peter Tchaikovsky. Marcus Shelby and his
  orchestra performed the “Harlem Nutcracker Suite” the last two years
  in Healdsburg and for the past decade at SFJAZZ. The music is wonderful a
 nd exciting for audiences of all ages\, who will recognize many of the end
 uring themes from the original “Nutcracker” by Tchaikovsky\, using the
  blues and swing as the vehicle for the music.
LOCATION:The Raven Performing Arts Theater
URL:https://healdsburgjazz.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
