UID:261014lgH-950I1E6eEi6zQ5ET_A
DESCRIPTION:Join California Naturalist John Lynch will lead this 3.5 mile\
 , 3.5-hour hike from creekside to hillside and back through the meadow\, u
 sing our cameras as tools to engage in the aesthetic appreciation of natur
 e while also documenting flora and fauna through iNaturalist. If you have 
 made an observation for a while\, this is your chance.Meet at the Visitor 
 Center\, where we will enjoy hot cocoa post-hike. Tickets are $10 for gene
 ral audiences\, $5 for students\, youth \\(12-17 years old\; children unde
 r 18 years old must be accompanied by a parent or guardian\\)\, Sugarloaf 
 members\, Sugarloaf volunteers\, and free for children under 12. Wear laye
 rs\, appropriate footwear for slippery/muddy trails\, bring at least a qua
 rt of water\, sun protection\, and a fully-charged cell phone or camera. H
 eavy rain cancels\; parking fees apply.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/sugarloaf-nature-photography-12192026
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chanting\, Meditation\, and Winter Solstice Ritual
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T210000
UID:261012mHrzrWXj10-Dc0vh4uOEQg
DESCRIPTION:with Jai Uttal\, Frank Ostaseski\, Nubia Teixeira and Prajna V
 ieira\n\nThe great love\, joy\, and sacred light that this season celebrat
 es are found within our own hearts. During our time together\, we will use
  the powerful and sublime blend of chanting and meditation to carry us fro
 m the frenzy of “holiday mind” to the ocean of the awakened heart. Thi
 s uplifting evening will include chanting \\(call and response\\) and medi
 tation\, and we will conclude with a beautiful candlelight ritual to honor
  the winter solstice.\n\nTogether we’ll experience the nourishment of in
 terconnection as we practice and pray in community for the healing of our 
 world. We’ll also share the innate joy that is uncovered when we collect
 ively chant \\(and dance\, if you feel moved to do so\\).
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/chanting-meditation-an
 d-winter-solstice-ritual-ja2e26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
